> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > >
> > > > > > ## plot bar chart
> > > > > > ggplot(SimpleDF,aes(x=Region, y=Attendance))+
> > > > > >         geom_bar(stat ="identity")
> > > > > >
> > > > > > ## Notice the variable 'Region' got rearranged in alphabetical order
> > > > > > ## Why doesn't maintain the order and what a way around it
