Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi, I'm trying to make a readable plot from a data set containing many conditions and am struggling to find a solution.

Basically I want to plot nuclear intensity (p65) as it relates to strain (RH, PRU, ME49), broken down by infection level (moi: 1, 5, 10, 20) and status (infected / uninfected).

I've attached shots of my data and code, and the plot that I have so far. The plot is close to what I want, but instead of having status overplotted, I would really like to separate them and have them plotted side by side so it is more apparent how they reflect p65 intensity.

Cheers!

