One solution would be to create a new variable which is a combination of status and moi. Map that to x axis and you're done. Something along the lines of

> raw.data$moi.status <- with(raw.data, paste(moi, status, sep = "_"))

and then

> ggplot(..., aes(x = moi.status, ...)) + ...

​Cheers,
Roman​

