Ah yes an excellent sleuth job here. Turns out that the wonderful folks developing "sf" have anticipated this issue and the function st_zm complete solved my issues. Full solution:

library(sf)
devtools::install_github("tidyverse/ggplot2")
library(ggplot2)

##To read the data in:
lakes_out <- st_read("lakes.shp")

lakes_out <- st_zm(lakes_out)

ggplot(lakes_out) +
  geom_sf()

Works!

Thanks Seth.

